    <!-- JS - Lighting Overhaul: Sun flare only. Rebuilt from vanilla (current game version) with a
         neutral "sunlight white" tint (~5800 K). Brightness (Intensity, alpha W) is unchanged from vanilla;
         RGB is rescaled per sub-glare to keep the same perceived brightness. Main glow enlarged 43000 -> 63000. -->
